 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Contract Accounting – Master Data and Basic Functions (2AR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8cc3d168b0f34f429ad36d83a2f8b656\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc3d168b0f34f429ad36d83a2f8b656__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Business Partner and Contract Management lets you create and manage master data of a business partner and a contract account for Convergent Contract Accounting (FI-CAC). In addition, you can analyze if business partner data can be deleted to satisfy data privacy constraints in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc3d168b0f34f429ad36d83a2f8b656__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a business partner</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a contract account</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check if a business partner can be blocked</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze business partner data</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc3d168b0f34f429ad36d83a2f8b656__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and change customer master data simply with SAP Fiori apps</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and change contract accounts to allow the invoicing of customers and posting of receivables and credits</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合同会计核算 - 主数据和基本功能 (2AR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8cc3d168b0f34f429ad36d83a2f8b656\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc3d168b0f34f429ad36d83a2f8b656__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">业务伙伴和合同管理允许您为集中合同会计 (FI-CAC) 创建和管理业务伙伴和合同科目的主数据。此外，您可以分析是否可以删除业务伙伴数据，以满足 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的数据隐私约束。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc3d168b0f34f429ad36d83a2f8b656__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建业务伙伴</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建合同科目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查是否可以冻结业务伙伴</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析业务伙伴数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8cc3d168b0f34f429ad36d83a2f8b656__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用 SAP Fiori 应用轻松创建和更改客户主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建和更改合同科目，以允许为客户开发票以及过账应收账款和贷项</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
